				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1480612#post-2426237</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1480612/f-o-u-r-t-e-e-n-thirteen#post-2426237</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 18 Dec 2015 13:54:08 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>sirpudding</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>348648</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm not sure this gives us anything really new about the setting, but it is definitely an entertaining read. Definitely reinforces the whole reverse Gnostics thing.</p> <p>Although I do wonder if the notion of Satan as a pair of snakes is a attempt to link Metaphysician's mythos with Pitch Haven; if it is I am not sure how I feel about that as both mythos address similar themes with very different styles that I don't feel gel well.</p> <blockquote> <p>If anyone had the right to change their’s</p> </blockquote> <p>&quot;Theirs&quot;, is like &quot;his&quot;, &quot;hers&quot;, and &quot;its&quot;; possessive pronouns do not have apostrophes.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
